' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' SOURCE CONSOLIDATED: diagram_36_qa_lab.puml
' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
note as BIZ_diagram_36_qa_lab
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A governed quality-assurance laboratory for the platform's integrations and
  critical workflows. Stores reusable test suites and cases, executable runs against
  named environments, per-case results, and — crucially — the exact request payloads
  SENT and response payloads RECEIVED for every step, so any integration failure can
  be reproduced, audited and diffed against the contract in module 12/31.
end note

