note as DEP_diagram_36_qa_lab
  Connects to other modules via:
  directory.tenants, iam.users, common.files (file_id, artifacts),
  integrations.integration_endpoints (test_cases.endpoint_id),
  terminology.catalog_concepts.
end note

note as REC_PAYLOAD_EVIDENCE_diagram_36_qa_lab
  PAYLOAD EVIDENCE
  request_payloads/response_payloads are append-only (<<LOG>>) and store the exact
  bytes sent and received per step, with body_hash for tamper-evidence and diffing.
  Redact/mask PII/PHI before persistence when the environment is not production-safe;
  bind sensitive fields to system_ops.field_registry masking strategies.
end note

' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' SOURCE CONSOLIDATED: diagram_36b_qa_lab_ext.puml
' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
note as BIZ_diagram_36b_qa_lab_ext
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  QA Lab extension. Adds scheduled/automated suite execution (continuous testing,
  a data-center standard) and a defect/flaky-tracking loop that turns failing
  test_case_results into triaged, deduplicated defects with an external issue ref.
  Closes the gap between running tests and acting on their failures.
end note

